  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3245.07 Law Enforcement Vehicles. If affixing an inspection sticker, in accordance with Saf-C 3245.06, on a law enforcement vehicle interferes with law enforcement equipment or technology, the inspection sticker shall be attached to the vehicle registration.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16; rpld by #12196, eff 10-1-17\n\nNew. #12932, eff 11-27-19\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16; rpld by #12196, eff 10-1-17",
